WEBVTT

00:10:30.876 --> 00:10:33.712
The first year we offered nine programs

00:10:33.754 --> 00:10:36.590
and there were 200 folks signed up.

00:10:37.257 --> 00:10:41.929
The next year, that number
expanded to 45 programs

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:45.391
with over 700 folks participating.

00:10:45.974 --> 00:10:50.187
And the following year
we offered over 90 programs

00:10:50.187 --> 00:10:53.732
and had 2,100 registrations.

00:10:54.149 --> 00:10:55.317
Amazing.

00:10:55.317 --> 00:11:00.197
(Applause)